        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="Source: product-order-management.service.js/controller and product-permissions.js. ADMIN currently handles Sale Staff tasks; STAFF is not independently permitted here. One successful CAS prevents the same transition/stock effect twice. This is distinct from returning a stored successful acknowledgement on retry. Carrier booking/payment itself remains external when described." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
